full-query: "Your team is developing an online bidding application which has used DynamoDB tables to store customers' information. The application requires the fastest possible response time for reads in microseconds. However, it seems that the existing DynamoDB tables cannot provide such performance. Which approach is the best to improve the read performance greatly without modifying existing application logic?"
